<title>USA: ESSEX INTERNATIONAL Q1 NET UP.</title>
<headline>ESSEX INTERNATIONAL Q1 NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		  1996</p>
<p>Shr			  $0.69		 $0.23</p>
<p>Net income		 19.2		   6.4</p>
<p>Net sales		 410.8		 308.4</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Higher net sales attributable to company's acquisition of Triangle Wire and Cable Inc in October 1996. The acquisition improved product pricing, which was partially offset by lower copper prices.</p>
<p>Full company name is Essex International Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
